<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Atkins Carlyle half yr profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Atkins Carlyle half yr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to November 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.92 vs 5.64</p>
